## 4. Abstract

The abstract provides a brief overview of the entire project.

### Sample Abstract

**PocketSmart AI: Your Smart Budget Recommendation Assistant** is a personal financial management system designed to help users monitor their income, expenses, budgets, and savings. The system allows users to record financial transactions, categorize expenses, set monthly budgets, and monitor their spending patterns.

The system analyzes the user's financial information and provides personalized recommendations based on spending behavior and budget limits. A dashboard presents important financial information such as total income, expenses, remaining budget, and spending categories. The system aims to make personal budgeting easier and help users develop better financial management habits.

