## 10. AI Recommendation Documentation

The documentation should explain how the intelligent recommendation component works.

### Recommendation Process

```text
User Data
    ↓
Income & Expense Collection
    ↓
Data Processing
    ↓
Spending Pattern Analysis
    ↓
Budget Comparison
    ↓
Identify Spending Issues
    ↓
Generate Recommendation
    ↓
Display to User
```

### Example

If a user's planned food budget is **₹5,000** but actual food expenses reach **₹7,500**, the system can identify the category as exceeding its planned limit and provide a recommendation to reduce or monitor food-related spending.

