## 16. Limitations

Possible limitations include:

* Recommendations depend on the accuracy of user-entered data.
* Initial recommendations may be based on limited historical information.
* Internet access may be required for certain AI features.
* The system may not provide professional financial advice.
* Advanced prediction capabilities may require a larger dataset.

